# lsp-mcp — env config
#
# Two auth modes, pick one:
#
# MODE A: Briefing mode (production / external tenants)
# Set LSP_TOKEN to the bearer JWT returned from a Tenant briefing redemption.
# One token, all granted modules.
#
# LSP_TOKEN=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...
#
# MODE B: Personal mode (platform team / dogfood)
# Set LSP_REPO_PATH to your LifeSpacePlatform checkout. The server auto-reads
# each service's admin API key from {LSP_REPO_PATH}/{Service}/.env.
#
# LSP_REPO_PATH=/Users/you/path/to/LifeSpacePlatform
#
# OR: set per-service admin API keys explicitly:
# DISPATCH_ADMIN_API_KEY=lsd_...
# KEYS_ADMIN_API_KEY=lsk_...
# MEMORY_ADMIN_API_KEY=lsm_...
# KNOWLEDGE_ADMIN_API_KEY=...
# PROJECTS_ADMIN_API_KEY=...
# LIBRARY_ADMIN_API_KEY=...
# TENANT_ADMIN_API_KEY=...
# TRUST_ADMIN_API_KEY=...
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MODE C: Remote HTTP server (LifeSpace Connect — dist/server-http.js).
# The stdio auth modes above do NOT apply — every /mcp request carries its own
# Trust JWT (minted by Connect after Google SSO). These are infra creds only:
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://...                     # shared platform Postgres
# TRUST_BASE_URL=https://trust.lifespace.com
# TRUST_JWT_PUBLIC_KEY=-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY----- # verifies access tokens (\n-escaped)
# TRUST_MINT_API_KEY=lsmint_...                    # shared secret for Trust /v1/mint
# CONNECT_TRUST_APP_ID=<uuid>                      # the lifespace-connect Trust app id
# CONNECT_BASE_URL=https://connect.lifespace.com   # issuer + OAuth callback base
# PORT=8080
